NOTE ON AUTHORSHIP

The code in this repository was written by an AI coding assistant --
Anthropic's Claude -- working under the direction of a human modder who did
the testing, made the design decisions, and verified every result in a VR
headset. Every fix in here was judged in a headset, not in a diff. The
copyright line above exists so the warranty disclaimer has a named party; it
is not a claim of authorship, and no restriction beyond the MIT terms is
intended. Use it, learn from it, fork it, take it apart.


NOTE ON GAME CONTENT

DOOM is a trademark of id Software / ZeniMax Media. This project is not
