It contains INJECTION CODE ONLY. No game assets, no decompiled or
disassembled game code, and no reproduced proprietary text are included or
redistributed. The reverse-engineering findings in docs/ENGINE-NOTES.md
describe offsets, structure semantics and observed behaviour in our own
words. You supply the game through your own legitimate DOOM (2016)
installation.

If you extend this project, keep it that way -- see
docs/FORBIDDEN-BOUNDARIES.md #12.


